                <Paragraph Name="1">
                  <Text>VACCINATION AGAINST YELLOW FEVER FOR ALL PASSENGERS.</Text>
                </Paragraph>
                <Paragraph Name="2">
                  <Text>MALARIA PROPHYLAXIS: MALARIA RISK, MAINLY DUE TO P. FALCIPARUM, EXISTS THROUGHOUT THE YEAR IN THE WHOLE COUNTRY. RECOMMENDED PREVENTION: C.</Text>
                </Paragraph>
