            <ns5:TransitLocation PassportType="SEAMAN">
              <ns3:Country Code="OM">OMAN</ns3:Country>
              <ns5:TransitCountryInformation SubTitle="TWOV (TRANSIT WITHOUT VISA)">
                <Paragraph Name="1">
                  <Text> VISA REQUIRED, EXCEPT FOR PASSENGERS WITH A CONFIRMED ONWARD TICKET FOR A FLIGHT TO A THIRD COUNTRY WITHIN 24 HOURS. THE CONNECTING FLIGHT MUST BE BOOKED ON THE SAME TICKET. THEY MUST STAY IN THE INTERNATIONAL TRANSIT AREA OF THE AIRPORT AND HAVE DOCUMENTS REQUIRED FOR THE NEXT DESTINATION.</Text>
                </Paragraph>
              </ns5:TransitCountryInformation>
              <ns5:TransitCountryInformation SubTitle="ADDITIONAL INFORMATION">
                <Paragraph Name="1">
                  <Text>PASSENGERS IN TRANSIT WITH A PRE-ARRANGED STOPOVER PAID BY CARRIER (STPC) AND A PASSPORT VALID FOR A MINIMUM OF 3 MONTHS ARE PERMITTED TO LEAVE THE AIRPORT.</Text>
